{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning? Did you say boring? No way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cleaning Simulator</i> invites you to grab your mop, vacuum cleaner, and sponge for a delightful cleaning adventure. Dirty floors, mountains of dishes, buzzing flies, dusty carpets, and chaotic rooms\u2026 They\u2019re all waiting for you. But don\u2019t worry\u2014if you\u2019ve got the right tools in hand, this mess will be sparkling clean in no time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play just to unwind or aim to complete every task and earn the title of <i>Cleaning Master</i>, the game lets you play your own way. Mop the floors, scrub surfaces with the sponge, load the dishwasher, take out the trash, spray the flies, vacuum the carpets, organize scattered items, and blast away stubborn grime with a pressure washer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching the environment transform as you clean is truly satisfying. And with HDR and ray tracing enabled, the way light gleams off those spotless surfaces\u2026 It actually makes you <i>want</i> to clean.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/b49a16f645090719ba7448ccc72f587a.poster.avif?t=1759419328\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/b49a16f645090719ba7448ccc72f587a.webm?t=1759419328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc <strong>What Can You Do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Mop the Floors</strong>: Use the mop to clean up stains and spills.<br>\ud83e\uddfd <strong>Scrub with the Sponge</strong>: Scrub walls, tables, and countertops thoroughly.<br>\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f <strong>Use the Dishwasher</strong>: Load dirty dishes, then put them away once they\u2019re clean.<br>\ud83e\udd9f <strong>Spray the Flies</strong>: Eliminate flies and keep things hygienic.<br>\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f <strong>Collect and Sort Trash</strong>: Pick up garbage, sort it, and throw it away.<br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Organize and Arrange Items</strong>: Tidy up scattered boxes and furniture.<br>\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Use the Pressure Washer</strong>: Blast away stubborn dirt with high-pressure water.<br>\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Use the Vacuum Cleaner</strong>: Vacuum the carpets and freshen up the floors.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/8704603712bedee76b705ac772f3c91f.poster.avif?t=1759419328\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/8704603712bedee76b705ac772f3c91f.webm?t=1759419328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Why Should You Play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because every cleaning job ends with that satisfying \u201cnailed it\u201d feeling.<br>Because with Ray Tracing and HDR, a freshly cleaned room looks stunning.<br>Because cleaning can be more relaxing than you'd expect.<br>Because sometimes, just ticking tasks off the list feels really good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s a messy student apartment, a cluttered warehouse, or a fly-infested kitchen\u2026 Every space will transform with your touch.<br>If you\u2019re ready, grab your sponge. The vacuum\u2019s running\u2014let the cleaning begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/03555b3678120cd3a1388a33cb46d940.avif?t=1759419328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","