y Should You Play?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because every cleaning job ends with that satisfying \u201cnailed it\u201d feeling.<br>Because with Ray Tracing and HDR, a freshly cleaned room looks stunning.<br>Because cleaning can be more relaxing than you'd expect.<br>Because sometimes, just ticking tasks off the list feels really good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s a messy student apartment, a cluttered warehouse, or a fly-infested kitchen\u2026 Every space will transform with your touch.<br>If you\u2019re ready, grab your sponge. The vacuum\u2019s running\u2014let the cleaning begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/extras/03555b3678120cd3a1388a33cb46d940.avif?t=1759419328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Damaged Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537950/668c1a5934f100df4597a25e8a5000def895715e/header.jpg?t=1759419328","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537950/2034395109/a237afe990acedb3599326006f6c5beff9f6fd85/1753700262/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753703458","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537950/2034395109/a237afe990acedb3599326006f6c5beff9f6fd85/1753700262/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753703458","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3537950/2034395109/a237afe990acedb3599326006f6c5beff9f6fd85/1753700262/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753703458","id":257174841,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174841/movie480.mp4?t=1753703458","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstat